{"seq":2,"slug":"currying-and-partial","title":"柯里化与偏应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/currying-and-partial","wordCount":823,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"柯里化与偏应用\">柯里化与偏应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>柯里化</strong>和<strong>偏应用</strong>都在做同一件事：把多参数函数&quot;喂&quot;成少参数函数。前者一次固定一个参数，后者一次可以固定多个。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>调用形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>柯里化</td>\n<td>多参数函数 → 单参数函数链</td>\n<td><code>f(1)(2)(3)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏应用</td>\n<td>固定部分参数生成新函数</td>\n<td><code>partial(f, 1, 2)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数顺序</td>\n<td>不常变的在前，常变的在后</td>\n<td>先固定配置，再传数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二者配合参数顺序设计，让&quot;配置一次、复用多次&quot;成为自然的表达方式，是日志工厂、API 客户端等模式的实现基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"柯里化的定义\">柯里化的定义</h2><p><strong>柯里化</strong>（Currying）是将一个接受多个参数的函数转换为一系列接受单个参数的函数的技术。它以数学家 Haskell Curry 的名字命名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"add :: Int -&gt; Int -&gt; Int&#10;add x y = x + y&#10;&#10;add3 :: Int -&gt; Int&#10;add3 = add 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>add :: Int -> Int -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add x y = x + y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add3 :: Int -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add3 = add 3</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const add =&#10;  (a: number) =&gt;&#10;  (b: number): number =&gt;&#10;    a + b;&#10;&#10;const add3 = add(3);&#10;const result = add3(5);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> add3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>函数签名</th>\n<th>调用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未柯里化</td>\n<td><code>(a, b, c) =&gt; d</code></td>\n<td><code>f(1, 2, 3)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柯里化</td>\n<td><code>a =&gt; b =&gt; c =&gt; d</code></td>\n<td><code>f(1)(2)(3)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏应用</td>\n<td>固定部分参数后的函数</td>\n<td><code>f(1)(2)</code> → 新函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    F[&quot;f(a, b, c)&quot;] --&gt;|柯里化| F1[&quot;f(a)&quot;]&#10;    F1 --&gt;|&quot;传入 a&quot;| F2[&quot;g(b)&quot;]&#10;    F2 --&gt;|&quot;传入 b&quot;| F3[&quot;h(c)&quot;]&#10;    F3 --&gt;|&quot;传入 c&quot;| R[&quot;结果&quot;]\">graph LR\n    F[\"f(a, b, c)\"] --&gt;|柯里化| F1[\"f(a)\"]\n    F1 --&gt;|\"传入 a\"| F2[\"g(b)\"]\n    F2 --&gt;|\"传入 b\"| F3[\"h(c)\"]\n    F3 --&gt;|\"传入 c\"| R[\"结果\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Haskell 中，所有函数默认都是柯里化的。<code>add 3 5</code> 实际上是 <code>(add 3) 5</code>——先用 <code>3</code> 调用 <code>add</code> 得到一个新函数，再用 <code>5</code> 调用这个新函数。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"通用柯里化实现\">通用柯里化实现</h2><p>在 JavaScript/TypeScript 中，可以编写一个通用的 curry 函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Curry&lt;Args extends unknown[], R&gt; = Args extends [infer First, ...infer Rest] ? (arg: First) =&gt; Curry&lt;Rest, R&gt; : R;&#10;&#10;const curry = &lt;Args extends unknown[], R&gt;(fn: (...args: Args) =&gt; R): Curry&lt;Args, R&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const arity = fn.length;&#10;  const curried = (...args: unknown[]): unknown =&gt;&#10;    args.length &gt;= arity ? fn(...(args as Args)) : (...more: unknown[]) =&gt; curried(...args, ...more);&#10;  return curried as Curry&lt;Args, R&gt;;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const multiply = (a: number, b: number, c: number): number =&gt; a * b * c;&#10;const curriedMultiply = curry(multiply);&#10;const double = curriedMultiply(2)(1);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Curry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">infer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> First</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...infer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> First</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Curry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Rest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Curry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> arity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fn.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curried</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    args.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(args </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">more</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curried</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">more);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curried </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Curry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> curriedMultiply</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(multiply);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> curriedMultiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同语言的柯里化支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>自动柯里化</th>\n<th>手动柯里化</th>\n<th>语法便利性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>✅ 默认</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F#</td>\n<td>✅ 默认</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>多参数列表</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>手动/库</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>闭包</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>functools</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"偏应用\">偏应用</h2><p><strong>偏应用</strong>（Partial Application）是固定一个函数的部分参数，生成一个接受剩余参数的新函数。偏应用与柯里化相关但不同——柯里化一次固定一个参数，偏应用可以一次固定多个。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const partial =&#10;  &lt;A extends unknown[], B extends unknown[], R&gt;(fn: (...args: [...A, ...B]) =&gt; R, ...fixed: A): ((...rest: B) =&gt; R) =&gt;&#10;  (...rest: B) =&gt;&#10;    fn(...fixed, ...rest);&#10;&#10;const log = (level: string, module: string, message: string): string =&gt; `[${level}] [${module}] ${message}`;&#10;&#10;const errorLog = partial(log, &#39;ERROR&#39;);&#10;const authError = partial(log, &#39;ERROR&#39;, &#39;AUTH&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> partial</